Subject: [PATCH] app: --minimise-after N: the window minimised (hidden if not
 honoured), its state and ticks said

For scripts/run-wake.sh: a window that does not tick. Measured under Xvfb with openbox:
minimised=1 occluded=1, ticks held at 30 for 20 s.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LFAGgPYzYByoQt6gue8ek5
---
